{"availability":"available","full":"uxlfoundation/oneDNN","name":"oneDNN","description":"Open-source library of optimized deep learning operations (matmul, convolution, attention) for CPUs (x64, AArch64, RISC-V) and Intel GPUs. Used by PyTorch, TensorFlow, OpenVINO, and ONNX Runtime.","category":"Education","language":"C++","stars":4060,"forks":1201,"created":"2016-05-09T23:26:42Z","updated":"2026-10-11T19:46:26Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"http://uxlfoundation.github.io/oneDNN/","topics":["aarch64","ace","amx","arm","avx10","convolution","cpp","deep-learning","inference","intel-gpu","llm","matmul","mxfp8","oneapi","onednn","performance","risc-v","sycl","x64","x86-64"],"demo":"http://uxlfoundation.github.io/oneDNN/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:35:55.137Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T22:35:55.137Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T22:35:55.137Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:35:55.137Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"curated-list","name":"Awesome Machine Learning","url":"https://github.com/josephmisiti/awesome-machine-learning"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T22:35:55.137Z","stars":4060,"forks":1201}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Highlights | Used By | Quick Start | Installation | Documentation | System Requirements","oneDNN is an open-source, cross-platform library of optimized deep learning operations for CPUs and GPUs. It provides highly optimized implementations of matrix multiplication, convolution, attention, normalization, and other operations, and is the acceleration layer behind PyTorch, TensorFlow, OpenVINO, and many other AI frameworks.","The library is optimized for Intel 64/AMD64 architecture based processors, Arm(R) 64-bit Architecture (AArch64)-based processors, and Intel Graphics. oneDNN has experimental support for the following architectures: NVIDIA\\ GPU, AMD\\ GPU, OpenPOWER\\ Power ISA (PPC64), IBMz\\ (s390x), and RISC-V."],"features":["Single API, many devices: The same code targets Intel64/AMD64, and AArch64,","RISC-V CPUs, and Intel GPUs.","Hardware specialization: oneDNN detects the hardware features at runtime","and JIT-generates kernels specialized for instruction set, number of cores, and cache sizes.","Low-precision inference: Supports f32, bf16, f16, fp8, fp4, u8/s8, and"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/uxlfoundation/oneDNN/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7df2aae085ff5f47ae0d5fd7fb582c8a8c8441efc515db271f665623546b24e9","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T22:35:55.137Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:35:55.137Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Highlights | Used By | Quick Start | Installation | Documentation | System Requirements","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/uxlfoundation/oneDNN/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"7df2aae085ff5f47ae0d5fd7fb582c8a8c8441efc515db271f665623546b24e9","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/uxlfoundation/oneDNN/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T22:35:55.137Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T19:46:26Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/uxlfoundation/oneDNN/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T22:42:27.338Z","hash":"7df2aae085ff5f47ae0d5fd7fb582c8a8c8441efc515db271f665623546b24e9","originalBytes":23261,"storedBytes":23261,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["intel","onednn","runtime","oneapi","gpu","compiler","support","cpu","library","license","build","dpc++","opencl","c++","amd","lake","tbb","architecture","following","formerly","gpus","graphics","later","processors","source","sycl","api","code","foundation","loader","openmp","requirements","version","engine","level","nvidia","uxl","aarch64","arm","core","dependencies","zero","additional","amd64","any","based","optimized","other","series","using","conda-forge","documentation","future","matmul","omp","software","acl","bit","configuration","github","guide","isa","performance","project","rapids","reference","s390